 "sentences": [
  "This antique carousel survived a building collapse.",
  "Installed in 1917, the ride sat near the White River in Indianapolis.",
  "The building housing it collapsed in 1956, destroying the ride's mechanism.",
  "Luckily, the wooden animals were stored safely away.",
  "The Children's Museum of Indianapolis eventually acquired the survivors.",
  "Restoration work finally finished in 1977, bringing the entire carousel back to life."
